{"municipality_code":"34101","pref":"広島県","city":"広島市中区","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられる可能性があります。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"広島市中区には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・地域信仰、城跡・武家文化、近代化・産業遺産に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では下村幸男や長沼健に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「広島護国神社」や「胡子神社」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":1430,"rank":59,"percentile":96.9,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":61,"rank":332,"percentile":82.5,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":51,"rank":450,"percentile":75.7,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":32,"rank":115,"percentile":93.4,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":13,"rank":357,"percentile":79.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":3,"rank":1069,"percentile":34.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":2,"rank":320,"percentile":69.8,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":3,"rank":1471,"percentile":20.4,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":2,"rank":33,"percentile":94.7,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["下村幸男","長沼健","今西和男","中沢啓治","阿川